      "note": "journal/review-frontier-results.html",
      "text": "On a sealed corpus of private changes, reviewed by every model through the same tool-free seat, the cheapest model, {cheapModel}, cost {cheapCost} per review and caught {cheapCaught} of {cheapOf} seeded defects; the dearest, {dearModel}, cost {dearCost} per review and caught {dearCaught} of {dearOf}. The catch intervals of all models in the experiment overlap, so on this corpus the price of a review varied far more than what it caught.",
